                <pb facs="d156-01" n="1" xml:id="d156-01"/>

                <head>156. Memorandum From Jeanne Davis of the National Security Council Staff to
                    the Deputy Secretaries of State (Ingersoll) and Defense (Clements), Director of
                    Central Intelligence Bush, and the Chairman, Joint Chiefs of Staff
                        (Smith)<anchor n="1" xml:id="d156-f1"/>
                    <anchor n="2" xml:id="d156-f2"/>
                </head>
                <dateline>
                    <placeName>Washington</placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1976-03-01"
                        >March 1, 1976</date>
                </dateline>
                <list subtype="subject" type="description">
                    <label>SUBJECT:</label>
                    <item>Summary of SRG Meeting on NSSM 233—The Future of Kagnew Station</item>
                </list>
                <p>A Senior Review Group meeting was held on February 12, 1976 to discuss the NSSM
                    233 study. At that meeting it was agreed that: <list>
                        <item>—There is a continuing need for the functions performed by the Kagnew
                            facility.</item>
                        <item>—The United States should remain in Kagnew as long as possible.</item>
                        <item>—The United States should not take any diplomatic initiatives or
                            precipitous action with the Ethiopian Government with regard to
                            Kagnew.</item>
                        <item>—If the Ethiopian Government begins to exert real pressure on the
                            United States regarding Kagnew we could then enter into bilateral talks
                            at a slow and deliberate pace and discuss the possibility of relocating
                            in Ethiopia.</item>
                        <item>—On a contingency basis alternate sites should be studied as part of
                                <hi rendition="#underline">NSSM 238—U.S. Policy Toward the Persian
                                Gulf</hi>.</item>
                    </list>
                </p>
                <closer><signed>Jeanne W. Davis</signed><affiliation>Staff
                    Secretary</affiliation></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
